title: A drag with the pencil selects text, typing replaces it, undo brings the selection back, and a click puts the caret on the letter clicked
prefs: {"minimap": false}
folders: edit-odd
limit: 40
forbid-log: cannot edit
expect-file: edit-odd/a.txt :: (?-i)\AOne of a\nsecond @of a\n\z

wait 3000
goto a.txt
wait 1200
tool edit
drag 662 245 853 245
wait 300
mark selected
wait 400
type FIRST
key undo
wait 300
mark selection-back
wait 400
type One
click 930 325
type @
wait 300
mark clicked
wait 400
key save
wait 600
quit
